  "details": "According to VRC Mobile Quality preset from the SDK MSAA should be set to 2x while in actual game build it completely disabled. This breaks Alpha to Coverage shaders that required in some cases as faster alternative for Cutout shaders on Quest build. Also game on Quest looks extremely pixelated now because missing MSAA.\nCurrently missing MSAA  breaks all vegetation in NieR:Automata flowers world since AtC shaders rely on MSAA. Oculus documentation recommends to have MSAA always enabled for Rift and Quest.",
